# OdooClaw gateway source: fetched by scripts/setup-odooclaw.sh from
# https://github.com/nicolasramos/odooclaw and used only as the docker build
# context of the `odooclaw` service. It is third-party code, not project code,
# so keep it out of this repository. Only the generated gateway config
# (config/config.json) is tracked — the gateway's own config.example.json
# stays ignored; credentials never live here, they go in .docker/odooclaw.env.
/*
!/config/
/config/*
!/config/config.json
!.gitignore
